      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "defaultValue": "\ud83d\udca1 <b>How it works:</b><br>\u2022 <b>Always-On:</b> Keeps the LED time continuously visible.<br>\u2022 <b>Stealth (1970 Push-to-Wake):</b> Replicates the original 1970 Pulsar push-button experience. The display rests in dark stealth mode until you <b>flick your wrist, tap your watch crystal, or touch the screen</b> (Pebble Time 2), illuminating the LEDs for 4 seconds."
      },
      {
        "type": "radiogroup",
        "messageKey": "AppKeyOperatingMode",
        "label": "Operating Mode",
        "defaultValue": "0",
        "options": [
          {
            "label": "Always-On",
            "value": "0"
          },
          {
            "label": "Stealth (Flick/Tap/Touch to Wake 4s)",
            "value": "1"
          }
        ]
      }
